      "text": "It is manna: for they wist not what it was, Ex. 16:15. children of Israel did eat manna forty years, Ex. 16:35. manna was as coriander seed, Num. 11:7. suffered thee to hunger, and fed thee with manna, Deut. 8:3. fed thee … with manna, which thy fathers knew not, Deut. 8:16. manna ceased on the morrow, Josh. 5:12. withheldest not thy manna from their mouth, Neh. 9:20. rained down manna upon them to eat, Ps. 78:24.",
